---
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="How Solutions for Women collects, uses and protects your information." updated="September 2026">
  <p>
    Solutions for Women respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect through this website,
    how we use it, and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We only collect information you choose to give us, for example when you:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>sign up for monthly updates and event reminders (name, email and, if you choose, phone number);</li>
    <li>send us a message through the contact form;</li>
    <li>sign up to volunteer at an event.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Donations are processed by PayPal. We do not see or store your card details. PayPal shares your name, email and
    donation amount with us so we can thank you and provide a receipt.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use your information to reply to you, send the updates you asked for, organize volunteers and acknowledge
    donations. We never sell, rent or trade your information.
  </p>

  <h2>Support groups</h2>
  <p>
    All support group discussions are confidential. We do not record groups or collect information about what is
    shared in them.
  </p>

  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>
    Form submissions are delivered to our email by FormSubmit, and donations are handled by PayPal. These providers
    process information on our behalf under their own privacy and security commitments.
  </p>

  <h2>Safety and security</h2>
  <p>
    This website is served over an encrypted connection (HTTPS). Access to the information you send us is limited to
    the people at Solutions for Women who need it to respond to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can unsubscribe from our emails at any time, or ask us to update or delete your information, by emailing{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or {site.phone}.
  </p>
</Legal>
